@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_UUID
@documentId = REPLACE_WITH_UPLOADED_UUID

### Database health only (200 / 503)
GET {{base}}/health

### Create (201); dueDate is a calendar date, not a timestamp
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Prepare Homework 4 demo","ownerName":"Tai","dueDate":"2026-09-30"}

### Invalid title (400), request ID ties response to log
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"   "}

### List (200)
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Update (200; missing resource 404)
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"done"}

### File upload; place a real harmless PDF at docs/sample.pdf (do not commit sensitive files)
POST {{base}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=HomeworkBoundary

--HomeworkBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--HomeworkBoundary--

### Metadata (200)
GET {{base}}/documents

### Returns JSON {url, expiresIn:60}; URL is a short-lived bearer credential
GET {{base}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download

### Delete only the document created for this demo (204)
DELETE {{base}}/documents/{{documentId}}
